msgid "By default Osclass uses web URLs which have question marks and lots of numbers in them, those are considered as \"not user friendly\". Friendly URLs improve the aesthetics, usability, and forward-compatibility of your links, but most important impact is SEO - only website with friendly URLs can get good SEO!"
